<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Borlotti App - Beta</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #1a202c;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #ecc94b;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #2d3748;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #ecc94b;
            color: #744210;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .logo {
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto; /* Centraliza horizontalmente */
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            object-fit: cover; /* Garante que a imagem cubra o círculo */
            border-radius: 50%; /* Deixa a imagem circular */
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* Sombra leve para destaque */
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        h2 {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #4a5568;
            text-align: left;
        }

        ul.features {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            text-align: left;
        }

        ul.features li::before {
            content: "✔️";
            margin-right: 0.5rem;
            color: green;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #a0aec0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

    <p><img src="{{ asset('images/borlotti.png') }}" class="logo" alt="Logo"></p>
    <h1>Welcome to Borlotti App</h1>
    <div class="badge">Beta</div>
    <p>Congratulations! You have successfully installed the <b>Borlotti App</b>. Your environment is ready for development.</p>
    <h2>🚀 Features</h2>
    <ul class="features">
        <li>Dependency Injection</li>
        <li>Twig</li>
        <li>PSR-7</li>
        <li>CSRF</li>
        <li>Database</li>
        <li>Eloquent</li>
        <li>PHP Dotenv</li>
        <li>Logger</li>
        <li>Migrations</li>
        <li>Seeders</li>
    </ul>

    <a href="{{ url_for('examples-lib') }}">Some basic examples with the available libraries.</a>

    <div class="footer">
        This is the default Borlotti App welcome page &mdash; replace it in production.
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
